    {
      "id": "section:1/block:14/seg:0",
      "source": "dm-crypt is transparent to the filesystem; fscrypt is transparent to applications but per-file.",
      "source_hash": 6017710096026126137,
      "context_hash": 9971411511399363233,
      "translation": "dm-crypt는 파일시스템에 투명하며, fscrypt는 애플리케이션에 투명하지만 파일 단위로 동작합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "dm-crypt": "dm-crypt",
        "fscrypt": "fscrypt"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:03:23.051232Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "dm-crypt: block-level encryption",
      "source_hash": 15171423703898701288,
      "context_hash": 7161643786913056561,
      "translation": "dm-crypt: 블록 수준 암호화",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "dm-crypt": "dm-crypt",
        "encryption": "암호화"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:03:23.051232Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "dm-crypt is a device mapper target that transparently encrypts reads and writes using the kernel crypto API.",
      "source_hash": 6691208018845397696,
      "context_hash": 6120814889654621212,
      "translation": "dm-crypt는 커널 crypto API를 사용하여 읽기와 쓰기를 투명하게 암호화하는 device mapper 타깃(디바이스 매퍼 타깃)입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "API": "API",
        "device": "디바이스",
        "dm-crypt": "dm-crypt"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:26:44.505446Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "LUKS: Linux Unified Key Setup",
      "source_hash": 14455528304692777732,
      "context_hash": 13557280510994831621,
      "translation": "LUKS: Linux Unified Key Setup",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Linux": "Linux"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:03:23.051232Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "LUKS is the standard format for dm-crypt volumes.",
      "source_hash": 981364654777760761,
      "context_hash": 17746932873496554183,
      "translation": "LUKS는 dm-crypt 볼륨의 표준 포맷입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "dm-crypt": "dm-crypt"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:03:23.051232Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:4/seg:1",
      "source": "It stores encrypted key material in a header, allowing multiple passphrases to unlock the same volume:",
      "source_hash": 4568394635698652055,
      "context_hash": 6601019831751106507,
      "translation": "LUKS는 암호화된 키 자료를 헤더에 저장하므로 여러 패스프레이즈로 같은 볼륨의 잠금을 해제할 수 있습니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:03:23.051233Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "dm-crypt internals",
      "source_hash": 5103829407111971651,
      "context_hash": 18202773901341621356,
      "translation": "dm-crypt 내부 구조",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "dm-crypt": "dm-crypt"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:03:23.051233Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:8/seg:0",
      "source": "AES-XTS: why not CBC?",
      "source_hash": 8265371212401159912,
      "context_hash": 14896916009110186663,
      "translation": "AES-XTS: 왜 CBC가 아닌가?",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:03:23.051233Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:9/seg:0",
      "source": "dm-crypt uses AES-XTS (XEX-based tweaked-codebook mode with ciphertext stealing) rather than AES-CBC for disk encryption:",
      "source_hash": 15449651288084461701,
      "context_hash": 10608054038961935971,
      "translation": "dm-crypt는 디스크 암호화에 AES-CBC 대신 AES-XTS(XEX-based tweaked-codebook mode with ciphertext stealing)를 사용합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "dm-crypt": "dm-crypt",
        "encryption": "암호화"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:03:23.051233Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:10/seg:0",
      "source": "**CBC weakness for disk encryption**: In CBC, sector 1 always encrypts to the same ciphertext for a given key (the IV is derived from the sector number).",
      "source_hash": 522166645007881422,
      "context_hash": 1963380354380603984,
      "translation": "**디스크 암호화에서 CBC의 약점**: CBC에서는 주어진 키에 대해 섹터 1이 항상 같은 암호문으로 암호화됩니다(IV가 섹터 번호에서 유도되기 때문입니다).",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "encryption": "암호화"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:03:23.051233Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:10/seg:1",
      "source": "An attacker can detect which sectors have identical plaintext.",
      "source_hash": 16631363375983177525,
      "context_hash": 3413427340673646197,
      "translation": "공격자는 어떤 섹터들의 평문이 동일한지 탐지할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:03:23.051233Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:10/seg:2",
      "source": "AES-XTS uses a tweak derived from the physical sector number, making each sector's encryption unique.",
      "source_hash": 13194089979683020575,
      "context_hash": 11403157805708505057,
      "translation": "AES-XTS는 물리 섹터 번호에서 유도한 tweak를 사용하여 섹터마다 고유하게 암호화되도록 합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "encryption": "암호화"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:03:23.051233Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:12/seg:0",
      "source": "IV generation",
      "source_hash": 1568450961924559176,
      "context_hash": 3537442134630293236,
      "translation": "IV 생성",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:03:23.051233Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:13/seg:0",
      "source": "dm-crypt supports several IV modes:",
      "source_hash": 11934331783316510426,
      "context_hash": 11005362047855096053,
      "translation": "dm-crypt는 여러 IV 모드를 지원합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "dm-crypt": "dm-crypt"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:03:23.051233Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "dm-integrity: authenticated block storage",
      "source_hash": 10963651329145845717,
      "context_hash": 18217679054294763087,
      "translation": "dm-integrity: 인증된 블록 스토리지",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:03:23.051233Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "dm-integrity adds a per-sector checksum to detect data corruption:",
      "source_hash": 13181677430635871972,
      "context_hash": 16745216646725032475,
      "translation": "dm-integrity는 섹터별 체크섬을 추가하여 데이터 손상을 탐지합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "checksum": "체크섬"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:03:23.051233Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "fscrypt: filesystem-level encryption",
      "source_hash": 17248192150103033431,
      "context_hash": 5058354166716046880,
      "translation": "fscrypt: 파일시스템 수준 암호화",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "encryption": "암호화",
        "fscrypt": "fscrypt"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:03:33.626483Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "fscrypt is built into ext4, f2fs, and ubifs.",
      "source_hash": 13783499092243053551,
      "context_hash": 765571901198485880,
      "translation": "fscrypt는 ext4, f2fs, ubifs에 내장되어 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "fscrypt": "fscrypt"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:03:33.626484Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "It encrypts file contents and filenames, with keys stored in the kernel keyring.",
      "source_hash": 3895561722497777677,
      "context_hash": 15038476218406474837,
      "translation": "파일 내용과 파일 이름을 암호화하며, 키는 커널 키링에 저장됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "keyring": "키링"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:26:44.505447Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Setting up fscrypt",
      "source_hash": 14447104741407177416,
      "context_hash": 18050327143999513077,
      "translation": "fscrypt 설정",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "fscrypt": "fscrypt"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:03:33.626485Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "Key hierarchy",
      "source_hash": 7363092601445137992,
      "context_hash": 17525605320644830092,
      "translation": "키 계층 구조",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:03:33.626485Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "fscrypt derives per-file keys from the master key using HKDF-SHA512:",
      "source_hash": 4017710925766836297,
      "context_hash": 13610972432859829092,
      "translation": "fscrypt는 HKDF-SHA512를 사용하여 마스터 키로부터 파일별 키를 유도합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "fscrypt": "fscrypt"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:03:33.626485Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:8/seg:0",
      "source": "The nonce stored in the inode is unique per file, ensuring different keys for files with identical content.",
      "source_hash": 17573837736733727529,
      "context_hash": 8502712783287784629,
      "translation": "inode에 저장되는 nonce는 파일마다 고유하므로, 내용이 동일한 파일이라도 서로 다른 키를 갖게 됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "inode": "inode"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:03:33.626485Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:9/seg:0",
      "source": "fscrypt policies",
      "source_hash": 8862517135057568471,
      "context_hash": 2798673505458606771,
      "translation": "fscrypt 정책",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "fscrypt": "fscrypt",
        "policies": "정책"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:03:33.626485Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:11/seg:0",
      "source": "fscrypt in the kernel",
      "source_hash": 8270442640146034547,
      "context_hash": 12083749508078511093,
